{"id":"e95b3854884b05a2","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-hyperfinite-equivalence-relation.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Hyperfinite Equivalence Relation","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-hyperfinite-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Hyperfinite Equivalence Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-hyperfinite-equivalence-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-hyperfinite-equivalence-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-hyperfinite-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Hyperfinite Equivalence Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-hyperfinite-equivalence-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-hyperfinite-equivalence-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-hyperfinite-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Hyperfinite Equivalence Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md\">../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,E\\in V\">\\(X,E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md\">../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4HyperfiniteEquivalenceRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4HyperfiniteEquivalenceRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}hyperfinite\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4HyperfiniteEquivalenceRelation}_S(X,E)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\tau_X,\\tau_{X^2}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X^2,\\tau_{X^2})\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}(E,X)\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(E,X^2,\\tau_{X^2})\\land\\exists F\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X^2))\\land E=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Borel}(F(n),X^2,\\tau_{X^2})\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}(F(n),X)\\land F(n)\\subseteq F(n+1)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(|\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F(n)\\}|\\in\\omega))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}hyperfinite\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4HyperfiniteEquivalenceRelation}_S(X,E)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\tau_X,\\tau_{X^2}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X^2,\\tau_{X^2})\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}(E,X)\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(E,X^2,\\tau_{X^2})\\land\\exists F\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X^2))\\land E=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Borel}(F(n),X^2,\\tau_{X^2})\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}(F(n),X)\\land F(n)\\subseteq F(n+1)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(|\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F(n)\\}|\\in\\omega))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (equivalence-relation predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-equivalence.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (Borel-set predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\op